{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115214","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115214","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1111521401:0":{"text":"우린 여기서 쓰러지지 않아! 난 안탄드라 언니, 그리고 모두와 함께 돌아갈 거야!","source_cn":"我们不会在这里倒下！我要和安丹姐姐——和大家一起回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x871AD4FA8DA2166E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1111521402:0":{"text":"내가 그의 공격을 막을 테니! 다들 그 기회를 노려!","source_cn":"我来抵御他的攻击！大家抓住机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C023771788230B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111521403:0":{"text":"집요한 아이들이여... 내가 마지막 문장에 마침표를 찍으면 너희의 고통도 끝나리라.","source_cn":"执拗的孩子们……痛苦就快结束了，我即将写完最后的一句。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB91B2317ABAE8AFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"카이","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"안탄드라","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:普鲁斯托":{"text":"플루스토","source":"普鲁斯托","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}